{"type":"request/header","seq":11,"time":1795090565733,"data":{"header":{"config":{"provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-flash","maxTokens":256000,"reasoningEffort":"high"},"adapterDefaults":{"reasoningEffort":true,"maxTokens":true},"tools":[{"name":"ask_user_question","description":"Ask the user a concise question when you need confirmation, a choice, or missing information before proceeding. An answer item with empty selected and no custom means the user skipped that question: continue without it, do not ask it again, and do not treat the skip as permission.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"questions":{"type":"array","description":"Questions to ask the user before continuing.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Stable id for this question; echoed in the answer."},"question":{"type":"string","description":"The specific question to ask the user."},"header":{"type":"string","description":"Optional short heading for the question, such as \"Confirm\" or \"Choose Mode\"."},"options":{"type":"array","description":"Optional choices to show the user. If you recommend one, put it first and append \"(Recommended)\" to that label.","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"Short user-facing option label."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"One sentence explaining the tradeoff or impact."}},"required":["label"]}},"multi_select":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the user may select more than one option. Defaults to false."}},"required":["id","question"]}}},"required":["questions"]}},{"name":"benchmark_fixture","description":"Read fixed mock business state. First initialize with the exact run_id from the benchmark prompt; read returns only currently released facts. submit records actual user-confirmed draft values and returns a staged mock receipt. Never submit before user confirmation. No real business actions, external network or unreleased future events.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"run_id":{"type":"string"},"action":{"type":"string","enum":["initialize","read","submit"]},"values":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["run_id","action"]}},{"name":"get_weather","description":"Look up current weather and a short daily forecast for a place, from Open-Meteo (no API key). Call it before recommending clothing or planning an outdoor activity, and ground every temperature, rain, wind, or UV claim in the numbers it returns. It requires a known place: if the user has not named one, collect it first with the render_ui form (mode \"form\", intent \"generic_filters\") instead of guessing a city or calling this tool without a location.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"location":{"type":"string","description":"Place name to look up, such as \"Shanghai\", \"Kyoto\", or \"Berlin, Germany\"."},"days":{"type":"integer","description":"How many days of daily outlook to include, 1 to 7. Defaults to 4."}},"required":["location"]}},{"name":"render_ui","description":"Generate a user-facing interface from supplied facts using json-render. Available as one presentation option alongside ordinary replies and ask_user_question.\nmode=display renders information and continues the turn; mode=form renders a form and ends the turn on success, waiting for a user submission.\nPut factual content and real field values in business_data. Describe the layout in user_query, at most 2000 characters.\nUse intent=generic_filters for form fields or generic_pick_one for real candidate choices. List required rich component names in components.\nFor Image in this installed adapter, use business_data={\"image\":\"<provided URL string>\",\"alt\":\"<provided description>\"}; request Image.props.src as that fixed string. Do not invent a URL or use a default demonstration image.\nA display needs the complete relevant facts and a written fallback. Failures are not successful displays. Do not repeat an unchanged failed call.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string","enum":["display","form"],"description":"display renders a read-only layout and continues the turn. form renders a form and ends the turn on success. mode does not select the catalog."},"user_query":{"type":"string","description":"Layout instruction in the user language, at most 2000 characters. Name every requested component explicitly and put facts in business_data."},"answer_presentation":{"type":"string","enum":["replace","supplement"],"description":"Display only: replace shows the complete interface instead of closing prose; supplement keeps the written answer beside the card."},"intent":{"type":"string","enum":["generic_filters","generic_pick_one","rich_content"],"description":"generic_filters or generic_pick_one for those forms. rich_content when the layout needs the rich catalog even if components is omitted. Omit for ordinary display."},"components":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","enum":["Image","ImageUpload","Tabs","MapPreview","SortableSequence","Collapsible","CodeBlock"]},"description":"Every rich component this layout needs. Any one selects rich_content for the whole page, including a mix with base or form components."},"prompt_mode":{"type":"string","enum":["full","progressive"],"description":"Optional server prompt mode. Only full or progressive."},"scene":{"type":"string","description":"Optional scene hint passed through to the renderer, such as kb."},"locale":{"type":"string","description":"Optional locale hint, such as zh-CN."},"business_data":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"description":"Structured facts the card must show. Required and must be non-empty for display and form. Include every requested value, title, description, number, and warning."}},"required":["mode","user_query"]}},{"name":"working_directory","description":"Read the current working directory, or change it with cd. Relative paths use the current directory. Existing shells and running processes keep their own directories.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"cd":{"type":"string","description":"Existing directory to enter. Omit to read the current directory."}}}}]},"reason":"initial"}}
